%% Source of truth for the "spec first" diagram on the Dev page.
%% Rendered to web/specflow.svg by `make diagram` — mermaid never ships to the browser.
%%
%% Same two constraints as the other three, both from the phone: keep it SHALLOW, and
%% keep labels SHORT — this one is also read by whoever is deciding where a change goes,
%% so each node names a file or a command rather than an abstraction.
%%{init: {"flowchart": {"nodeSpacing": 18, "rankSpacing": 28, "padding": 6, "useMaxWidth": true}}}%%
graph TD
  Need["a feature to build"] --> Sec["write the section"]
  Sec --> Ann["annotate: api · env · test"]
  Ann --> Check["make check"]
  Check -->|red: names don't exist| Code["write the test, then the code"]
  Code --> Check
  Check -->|green| Spec["spec.json regenerates"]
  Spec --> Agent["an agent reads it and implements"]
